/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"colorful_cover_inner\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#333333\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group colorful_cover_inner has-text-color\" style=\"color:#333333\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"51px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:51px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"colorful_Heading_New_Basic\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group colorful_Heading_New_Basic\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"className\":\"large-size-heading\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"letterSpacing\":\"-1px\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center large-size-heading\" style=\"letter-spacing:-1px\">こんなことにお悩みの方は<br>お料理代行をオススメしてます♪</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"61px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:61px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"gap-0 mg-0\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns gap-0 mg-0\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:cover {\"customOverlayColor\":\"#f2e6cc\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"isDark\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#f2e6cc\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":3862,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://lptemp.com/dx/wp-content/uploads/cook01-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3862\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">毎日の献立に悩んでいる</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>日々の献立を考えることが大変で、いつもワンパターンな食事になってしまっている</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:cover {\"customOverlayColor\":\"#f4f4f4\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"isDark\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":3863,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://lptemp.com/dx/wp-content/uploads/eat01-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3863\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">栄養バランスが取れてるか心配</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>いつも同じようなメニューが続いていることで、栄養バランスが取れてないことに不安を感じる</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"className\":\"gap-0 flx_direc_revs\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns gap-0 flx_direc_revs\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:cover {\"customOverlayColor\":\"#f4f4f4\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"isDark\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#f4f4f4\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":3864,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://lptemp.com/dx/wp-content/uploads/cook02-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3864\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">普段とは違う食事を楽しみたい</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>新型コロナが発生して以降、外食に行きにくくなったので、自宅でプロの味を楽しみたい。</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:cover {\"customOverlayColor\":\"#f2e6cc\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":true,\"isDark\":false} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#f2e6cc\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":3865,\"sizeSlug\":\"medium\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"is-style-rounded\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-medium is-style-rounded\"><img src=\"https://lptemp.com/dx/wp-content/uploads/family01-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3865\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":3,\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-medium-font-size\">たまには食事づくりから解放されたい</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>毎日料理を作る時間を、たまには家族や自分のために使いたいと考えている</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"30px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://lptemp.com/dx/wp-con