。</strong><br><strong>まずは仕組みや活用方法のご相談だけでも可能です。</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:vk-blocks/button {\"buttonSize\":\"lg\",\"buttonEffect\":\"shine\",\"buttonColor\":\"custom\",\"buttonTextColorCustom\":\"vk-color-primary\",\"buttonColorCustom\":\"#fefefe\",\"buttonAlign\":\"wide\",\"blockId\":\"1e4deb2e-5e02-4f97-9b59-a3295d5f32e3\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-1e4deb2e-5e02-4f97-9b59-a3295d5f32e3 vk_button-align-wide is-style-shine\"><a class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background btn has-text-color has-vk-color-primary-color btn-lg\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\"><strong>REHAPについて問い合わせる</strong></span></div></a></div><style type=\"text/css\">.vk_button-1e4deb2e-5e02-4f97-9b59-a3295d5f32e3 .has-background {\n				background-color: #fefefe;\n				border: 1px solid #fefefe;\n			} </style>\n<!-- /wp:vk-blocks/button --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:vk-blocks/spacer {\"pc\":120,\"tablet\":50,\"mobile\":40,\"spaceSize\":\"custom\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer\"><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-pc\" style=\"margin-top:120px\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-tablet\" style=\"margin-top:50px\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-mobile\" style=\"margin-top:40px\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:vk-blocks/spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"vk_block-margin-0\\u002d\\u002dmargin-bottom\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vk-color-primary\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vk-color-primary\",\"fontSize\":\"huge\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom has-vk-color-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-huge-font-size\"><strong>運用の流れ</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"vk_block-margin-lg\\u002d\\u002dmargin-bottom\",\"st