。</strong><br><strong>まずは仕組みや活用方法のご相談だけでも可能です。</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:vk-blocks/button {\"buttonSize\":\"lg\",\"buttonEffect\":\"shine\",\"buttonColor\":\"custom\",\"buttonTextColorCustom\":\"vk-color-primary\",\"buttonColorCustom\":\"#fefefe\",\"buttonAlign\":\"wide\",\"blockId\":\"40220692-acbb-46ca-9bdd-c230b4887bf4\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-button vk_button vk_button-color-custom vk_button-40220692-acbb-46ca-9bdd-c230b4887bf4 vk_button-align-wide is-style-shine\"><a class=\"vk_button_link btn has-background btn has-text-color has-vk-color-primary-color btn-lg\" role=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" rel=\"noopener\"><div class=\"vk_button_link_caption\"><span class=\"vk_button_link_txt\"><strong>REHAPについて問い合わせる</strong></span></div></a></div><style type=\"text/css\">.vk_button-40220692-acbb-46ca-9bdd-c230b4887bf4 .has-background {\n				background-color: #fefefe;\n				border: 1px solid #fefefe;\n			} </style>\n<!-- /wp:vk-blocks/button --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:vk-blocks/spacer {\"pc\":120,\"tablet\":50,\"mobile\":40,\"spaceSize\":\"custom\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-vk-blocks-spacer vk_spacer\"><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-pc\" style=\"margin-top:120px\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-tablet\" style=\"margin-top:50px\"></div><div class=\"vk_spacer-display-mobile\" style=\"margin-top:40px\"></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:vk-blocks/spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"vk_block-margin-0\\u002d\\u002dmargin-bottom\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vk-color-primary\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vk-color-primary\",\"fontSize\":\"huge\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center vk_block-margin-0--margin-bottom has-vk-color-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-huge-font-size\"><strong>運用の流れ</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"vk_block-margin-lg\\u002d\\u002dmargin-bottom\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vk-color-primary\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vk-color-primary\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center vk_block-margin-lg--margin-bottom has-vk-color-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color\"><strong>Flow</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"className\":\"vk_block-margin-lg\\u002d\\u002dmargin-bottom\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vk-color-primary\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vk-color-primary\",\"fontSize\":\"regular\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center vk_block-margin-lg--margin-bottom has-vk-color-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-regular-font-size\"><strong>ーREHAP導入から成果報酬ー</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:uagb/content-timeline {\"classMigrate\":true,\"childMigrate\":true,\"align\":\"center\",\"headingColor\":\"#151515\",\"subHeadingColor\":\"\",\"separatorFillColor\":\"#942b2b\",\"borderFocus\":\"#942b2b\",\"horizontalSpace\":24,\"verticalSpace\":42,\"timelinAlignment\":\"left\",\"timelinAlignmentTablet\":\"left\",\"timelinAlignmentMobile\":\"left\",\"arrowlinAlignment\":\"top\",\"borderwidth\":1,\"iconBgFocus\":\"#942b2b\",\"dateFontSizeType\":\"px\",\"connectorBgsize\":45,\"block_id\":\"ed6a678b\",\"iconSize\":15,\"displayPostDate\":false,\"leftPadding\":0,\"rightPadding\":0,\"topPadding\":0,\"bottomPadding\":10} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-content-timeline uagb-timeline__outer-wrap uagb-block-ed6a678b uagb-timeline__content-wrap uagb-timeline__left-block uagb-timeline__arrow-top  uagb-timeline\"><!-- wp:uagb/content-timeline-child {\"content_class\":\"uagb-timeline__left\",\"dayalign_class\":\"uagb-timeline__day-new uagb-timeline__day-left\",\"time_heading\":\"\\u003cstrong\\u003e店舗登録\\u003c/strong\\u003e\",\"time_desc\":\"REHAPに店舗登録後、成果管理画面にログインできます。\",\"block_id\":\"f78a816e\",\"displayPostDate\":true} -->\n<article class=\"wp-block-uagb-content-timeline-child uagb-timeline